{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Dreams is a game where you control a young girl who has gone on a trip to the countryside, landing in a secluded country house in the city. During your sleep, you wake up with unusual events happening, figure out a way to get everything back to normal, or if not, you'll never get out of this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various items and discover various events that can help you on this journey, survive while everything around you tries to kill you. Even if all seems lost, there will still be a light at the end of the tunnel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668350/extras/0be966deaeb328eb6b3e0fa1b690ad91.poster.avif?t=1769004249\" width=47 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668350/extras/0be966deaeb328eb6b3e0fa1b690ad91.webm?t=1769004249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an abandoned house and uncover the mysteries left behind by past generations, use the environment to decipher hidden puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668350/extras/c2e1ba2486fceea2b8d2db3eec92cf65.poster.avif?t=1769004249\" width=126 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668350/extras/c2e1ba2486fceea2b8d2db3eec92cf65.webm?t=1769004249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668350/extras/07af9953b59c0f26b0336827eff87e04.apng?t=1769004249\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668350/extras/07af9953b59c0f26b0336827eff87e04.poster.avif?t=1769004249\" class=\"bb_img\" width=90 height=134 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee from or defeat diverse monsters, use a variety of gameplay styles to reach your goals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668350/extras/6fb22e3cabbba0c533bd184b2883eda7.poster.avif?t=1769004249\" width=76 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668350/extras/6fb22e3cabbba0c533bd184b2883eda7.webm?t=1769004249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience multiple endings that complement both gameplay and story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668350/extras/bf2577c6e222c11cae06aa26e09e04db.poster.avif?t=1769004249\" width=52 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668350/extras/bf2577c6e222c11cae06aa26e09e04db.webm?t=1769004249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival, exploration and investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_para